GsWoodenBoomerang.Desc:
	'''
	Living wood remembers the throw: after its first hit it rebounds toward another nearby foe
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsEnchantedBoomerang.Desc:
	'''
	Decelerates outbound, gathers starlight while hovering, accelerates home
	At the hover peak it flings three homing star sparks, each dealing 30% damage
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsFruitcakeChakram.Desc:
	'''
	Outbound hits frost the target with sugar glaze, up to three coats
	Hitting a glazed target on the return detonates every coat, 25% bonus damage per coat
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsBloodyMachete.Desc:
	'''
	Hits inflict Bleeding and carve a tally; three tallies on one target let the blood loose
	The bloodletting strike deals 40% bonus damage and heals you for 2 life
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsIceBoomerang.Desc:
	'''
	Hits inflict Frostburn and shatter off two piercing ice shards, each dealing 25% damage
	While hovering it frosts over, wreathed in freezing mist
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsShroomerang.Desc:
	'''
	At the hover peak it puffs out a lingering spore cloud that keeps searing foes inside
	The flight path rains glowing spores
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsThornChakram.Desc:
	'''
	Hits poison the target and burst three thorn spikes outward, each dealing 22% damage
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsCombatWrench.Desc:
	'''
	Every third hit on the same target is a bolt-knock: 80% bonus damage
	Bolt-knocks against steel constructs gain another 25%
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsFlamarang.Desc:
	'''
	Every hit sets the target on fire
	At the hover peak it bursts into a ring of flame; the return path drops smoldering embers
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsTrimarang.Desc:
	'''
	Up to three airborne; each extra boomerang in flight grants all of them 8% damage
	Right click: the whole squad dashes toward your cursor at once
	'''
GsFlyingKnife.Desc:
	'''
	Hold the attack button to steer the knife after your cursor
	Release it to whirl in place, slashing all around, then carve a straight line home
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsBananarang.Desc:
	'''
	Throw up to ten; every hit ripens that banana, 6% bonus damage per stage, five stages max
	Right click: every airborne banana dashes toward your cursor at once
	'''
GsLightDisc.Desc:
	'''
	On hitting a foe it refracts toward the nearest other enemy, up to three times
	Each refraction loses 10% damage
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsPossessedHatchet.Desc:
	'''
	A wind-up throw: the possessed axe accelerates after its prey, then latches on,
	whirling around the victim; every slash brands a soul mark, the fifth ruptures for 150% damage
	Right click while it flies: command it to redirect its hunt
	'''
GsPaladinsHammer.Desc:
	'''
	A two-handed overhead throw; the hammer arcs heavily through the air
	At the end of its flight it rises, then slams down for 65% area damage and a shockwave
	Right click while it flies: it dashes to your cursor and delivers the slam there
	'''
GsSergeantUnitedShield.Desc:
	'''
	Outbound it ricochets between foes up to four times, knocking harder with every bounce
	Catching it raises your guard for a moment, blocking one instance of damage
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor
	'''
GsAnchor.Desc:
	'''
	Flies in a heavy arc, then plunges straight down past its peak
	The slam quakes the ground for 60% area damage; the anchor digs in, then reels home along its chain
	Right click while it flies: command it to dash toward your cursor first
	'''
